# Quarantined tests — excluded from the full-CI gate (scripts/ci/full-ci.mjs).
#
# Format: <test-file path relative to repo root>  # reason (owner, date)
# A reason comment is MANDATORY — entries without one fail the gate.
#
# Rules (SCLI-11):
# - Quarantine is for flaky/slow tests parked EXPLICITLY, never a dumping ground.
# - Every entry is printed loudly on every CI run; fix or remove promptly.
# - Removing a test from the suite any other way (deleting, .skip without a
#   linked task) is not allowed.
#
# (empty — keep it that way)
